      "key": "plan-new-video",
      "label": "Plan a new demo video",
      "body": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-demo-video-factory` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then turn the idea I describe into a video: one-sentence purpose, a hook + pain-point pair, the core concept, and status idea. Verify every product claim against the real codebase before ever moving status past needs_review."
