    {
      "key": "advance-video-status",
      "label": "Move a video to its next status",
      "body": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-demo-video-factory` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then advance the video I name to its next status (idea -> needs_review -> approved -> recording -> post_production -> done). Never mark a video approved without a verified-claims correction table already in place, and never merge the change without my explicit go-ahead."
